    "Condition : 1 - \r\nThe proposed change of use from an educational facility to a beauty/ sunbed shop is considered unsuitable in a building that is intended for a B1 Office use in a Town Centre Location.  The unit also has no history of Planning Permission being granted for a change of use to educational use.  The proposal is contrary to the UDP Policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), S.3.1 (New Retail Development) and E.1.5 (Development involving the loss or change in employment use) and emerging policy (the Council's Employment Development Plan Document). \r\n\r\n\r\n"
